 """notify-digest — poll a few feeds, filter them, send digests to channels.
 
 Run from cron. See README.md.
+
+Each run only dispatches items that are new since the last run; the SQLite
+archive in the store is the seen-items record, so unchanged feeds do not get
+re-sent on every cron tick.
 """
 
